  "effect_entries": [
    {
      "effect": "",
      "short_effect": "Réveille le Crabaraque bloquant le chemin dans la Grotte Littorale.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "",
      "short_effect": "Wakes up the Crustle blocking the way in Seaside Cave.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "A special device that wrings out\nthe potential of Pokémon.\nIt is an imperfect prototype.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポケモンの　のうりょくを　むりやり\nめざめさせる　とくしゅな　そうち。\nだが　しさくひんのため　ふかんぜん。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "포켓몬의 능력을 강제로\n눈뜨게 만드는 특수 장치.\n그러나 시작품이기에 불완전하다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un appareil spécial qui permet d’éveiller de force\nla puissance des Pokémon. Mais il ne s’agit que\nd’un prototype.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Vorrichtung, die verborgene Kräfte in den\nPokémon weckt. Es handelt sich dabei um einen\nunfertigen Prototyp.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Al usarse en un huerto de bayas, aumenta la\ncosecha obtenida si se riega con frecuencia.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Prototipo imperfetto di un dispositivo speciale\nideato per risvegliare in modo forzato le capacità\ndei Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A special device that wrings out\nthe potential of Pokémon.\nIt is an imperfect prototype.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポケモンの　能力を　無理やり\n目覚めさせる　特殊な　装置。\nだが　試作品のため　不完全。",
